  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Just Kissed My Baby**: rare: 11 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk4v-mk5.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 11 songs; 96 min [1]\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk41**: source not stated; 11 songs; 96 min [3]\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk4v-mk5.flac16**: source not stated; 11 songs; 96 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ryan Zoidis played saxophone from Cannonball through the encore [1]\n- Taylor Hicks joined on harmonica and vocals for Just Kissed My Baby and the encore [1]\n- Jamie McLean played guitar on Do It Again [1]\n- Ryan Zoidis played saxophone, Taylor Hicks harmonica/vocals, and Jamie McLean guitar as guests [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk4v-mk5.flac24**: taped by Taylor Caine; transferred by taylorc; source: [24bit] Schoeps mk4v> KC5> M222> NT222> Aeta PSP-3 + Schoeps mk5> KCY> VST62IU> Apogee AD-1000(@20bit)> SD 744t (@24bit/48kHz) [1]\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk41**: taped by Dennis Tyler; transferred by Dennis Tyler; source: Schoeps CMR/mk41 (DIN) > Naiant PFA > Oade Concert Mod Marantz PMD-661 (24/48) [3]. Also: Transfer path: SDHC card to hard drive, Wavelab 6, CD Wave, then FLAC [3]\n- **soulive2011-05-04.mk4v-mk5.flac16**: taped by Taylor Caine; transferred by taylorc; source: [16bit] Schoeps mk4v> KC5> M222> NT222> Aeta PSP-3 + Schoeps mk5> KCY> VST62IU> Apogee AD-1000(@20bit)> SD 744t (@24bit/48kHz) [2]",
